{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CABRWKR7aaq1zQYPkh4LAo","type":"tool_result","content":"43: * 8a. STANDARD FEATURES come with every game (10b): a pause menu with settings and controls the player rebinds, saved\n315:   the pause menu's Save and Load (section 10k); FADES: the transitions by name (game.go's fade) */\n1690:    /** game: its game; items: this frame's queue (sorted by depth when the frame ends) */\n2378:     *  updateMs, renderMs: milliseconds the last frame spent updating and drawing; steps: the updates it ran; items:\n2380:    this.stats = { updateMs: 0, renderMs: 0, frameMs: 16.7, steps: 0, items: 0, actors: 0, culled: 0 };\n3129:    b.style.cssText = 'width:44px;height:44px;display:none;place-items:center;padding:0;margin:0;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);background:rgba(8,8,18,.6);color:#f4f0ff;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent';\n3810: *    the pause menu, each opening the standard screen (the slots with their place, level and time; save, load, copy and\n3824:    /** canSave: the pause menu offers Save (a JRPG turns it off away from save points); played: seconds played in the\n3918:HOOKS.pause = (sh, acts) => {   // the pause menu's Save and Load, with menu: { saves }\n4787:  constructor(specs, o = {}) { this.moves = specs.map(sp => sp instanceof Attack ? sp : new Attack(sp)); this.window = o.window === undefined ? .3 : o.window; this.step = -1; this.idle = 99; }   // items: specs, Attacks or move names\n9031: * Menu with a cursor (title screens, pause menus, shops, battle commands).\n9038:    /** game: its game; items: the entries (strings, or { label, disabled }); i: the one under the cursor; active:\n9098: *      const ui = new E.Shell(game, { theme: { accent: '#d9b77c' }, settings: { items: ['sound', 'volume', 'motion'] },\n9115: *    defaults). new E.Game({ menu: { items: [['Restart', fn]], settings: [...], controls: { attack: 'Sword', skill:\n9116: *    false }, quit: 'title' } }) adjusts it; menu: false, or new E.Shell(game, { standard: false }), leaves it out.\n9134:.esh-pr{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:calc(var(--pb) + 44px);transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-width:200px}\n9137:.esh-col{position:absolute;right:var(--pr);top:var(--pt);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px}.esh-place{text-align:right;font:italic 13px var(--title);color:var(--muted)}\n9142:.esh-sh{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#04060acc;pointer-events:auto;padding:calc(var(--pt) + 46px) var(--pr) var(--pb) var(--pl);animation:esh-in .25s;touch-action:pan-y}.esh-ttl{padding-top:var(--pt)}\n9144:.esh .esh-nav{position:fixed;top:calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));z-index:2;width:44px;height:44px;min-height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(8,8,18,.6);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);pointer-events:auto}\n9147:.esh-ttl{place-items:center start;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#04060aee,#04060a99 50%,#04060a00 85%)}.esh-ttl>div{max-width:min(520px,92vw);padding-left:4vw}\n9153:.esh-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.esh-row button{min-width:64px;text-align:center}\n9154:.esh input[type=range]{accent-color:var(--accent);width:140px}.esh-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:6px 14px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center}\n9160:.esh-ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.esh output{min-width:46px;text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n9162:.esh-bind{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr minmax(92px,auto) minmax(92px,auto);gap:6px 10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}.esh-bind small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center}\n9176:   * - settings: settings.items: